issue.body:
Both of these asserts fail when IgnoreCase indicates they should pass:

```
        var actualValues = new Dictionary<int, string> {{ 1, "a" }};
        var expectedValues = new Dictionary<int, string> {{ 1, "A" }};
        Assert.That(actualValues, Is.EquivalentTo(expectedValues).IgnoreCase);

        var actualKeys = new Dictionary<string, int> {{"a", 1}};
        var expectedKeys = new Dictionary<string, int> {{ "A", 1 }};
        Assert.That(actualKeys, Is.EquivalentTo(expectedKeys).IgnoreCase);
```
